libeasymcp2221 (2.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add AppStream USB modalias metadata for MCP2221 hardware discovery.
  * Improve Debian package sections, descriptions and documentation contents.
  * Enable bind-now hardening for Debian shared-library builds.
  * Add Debian symbols metadata for ABI-aware dependency generation.
  * Synchronize the GitHub Wiki automatically after successful v2 releases.

 -- Tobias X. Vogel <tobias.vogel@linux.com>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 16:15:00 +0200

libeasymcp2221 (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Harden MCP2221 protocol validation, I2C recovery and error propagation.
  * Fix malformed-response handling across SRAM, flash, GPIO and analog APIs.
  * Add full 62-byte Write Flash Data support with mcp2221_flash_write_ex().
  * Improve USB endpoint discovery, device identity and handle lifetime logic.
  * Strengthen native MSVC, MinGW, Debian static-link and release validation.
  * Refresh public API contracts, regression tests and release documentation.

 -- Tobias X. Vogel <tobias.vogel@linux.com>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:11:00 +0200

libeasymcp2221 (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release the incompatible 2.0 API.
  * Remove deprecated 1.x compatibility APIs.
  * Finalize explicit error-code, ownership and initialization contracts.
  * Align command retry behavior with MCP2221 hardware and EasyMCP2221 quirks.
  * Harden SRAM, flash, GPIO, I2C, USB and analog API behavior and tests.
  * Finalize installation, pkg-config, Debian packaging and ABI visibility.
  * Complete migration, API-reference and build documentation for 2.0.

 -- Tobias X. Vogel <tobias.vogel@linux.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 16:49:00 +0200

